{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他现在在意的，是当靠近这件重要的事开始让期待变得鲜明时，自己还能不能留在这种期待里，而不急着把一时的前倾和明亮当成“已经有了答案”。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H1已经建立：他想靠近重要之物，但不要求它立刻给出明确答案或结果。\",\"bridge\":\"正因为“靠近而暂不索取答案”已经是他的关切，当前从安静维持到歌唱线进入、逐渐装饰并推高，再在突出后减弱，可以被理解为同一关切内部的一次具体体验：靠近本身会把期待抬高，但期待变强仍不自动变成确认。这里的变化只说明他的内在期待有起伏，不说明外界作出了回应。\",\"current\":\"因此现在的体验不是单纯更投入，而是他短暂允许自己更明显地期待、向前倾，同时仍把结果悬置；随后力度与姿态收回，也不需要解释成失望或问题解决，只是没有把那阵期待固定成结论。\",\"without\":\"如果没有H1，当前这些起伏只能说明表达由含蓄变得更鲜明再回落；没有理由把它理解成“期待升高但仍不索取确认”这一特定心理形态。\"},\"used\":[\"H1\"],\"new_history\":[\"当靠近感变得鲜明时，他的期待会随之抬高，但期待的抬高本身不会被他直接当成事情已有结果。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"H1提供了“靠近但不要求答案”的具体前提；本段新增的是期待升高与结果确认之间仍被区分这一可复用心理事实。没有把高潮或回落写成对方回应、关系进展、失望或解决。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "86b071e0-8a2e-4455-a530-97686909bc73", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214530919543Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.297, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:46:13.229514+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6d48bd4706e83752ad531241d46a8c6af5c0208c68d870987d60ac79c979f9e5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214530919543Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f8ba46fd4c356d3ab92a5270c556a7b800cec7713e744279c93a7fb22b5c4b61"}}}
